<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1507_5425.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser früntlich diennst unnd was wir eren liebs
<lb n="2"/>unnd guots vermügen zuovor, fromen fürsichtigen er-
<lb n="3"/>samen unnd wyßen innsonders guoten fründen,
<lb n="4"/>unnd gethrüwen lieben <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Eydtgnossen</orgName>. Wir werdend
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berichtett</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellcher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">massen</unclear> üwer mitburger herr
<lb n="6"/><persName resp="#ner">Sigmund <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zollikhoffer</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sinen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sitz</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Grüenenstein</unclear></placeName> inn
<lb n="7"/>unnserer herrschafft unnd vogty im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rynthal</unclear></placeName> gelegen,
<lb n="8"/>gegen einen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtsgelerrten</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-77" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ravenspurg</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="9"/>umb ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">benennte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suma</unclear> gelts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkhaufft</unclear> habe.
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dewyll</unclear> aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermelte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köuffer</unclear> uff denselben,
<lb n="11"/>sinen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erkhaufften</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sitz</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Grüenenstein</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hußhäblich</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>gezogen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kauffbrieff</unclear>, wie der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauff</unclear> ergangen,
<lb n="13"/>an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepürenden</unclear> orthen angegeben, ein guot zyt da-
<lb n="14"/>selbst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewont</unclear>, und sich einiger sachen nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erclagt</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>sonder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erst</unclear> darzuo by den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkhöuffern</unclear>, wegen,
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inzugs</unclear>, by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanndtvogt</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kauff</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versprochne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versprochne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verglychung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zudreffen</unclear>, oder
<lb n="18"/>sölche verglychung, gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">übersendung</unclear> 75. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ungrischer</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ducaten</unclear> ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köuffer</unclear> hinzuo geben, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernst</unclear> schrifft-
<lb n="20"/>lich angehalten, ouch er der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köuffer</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauffsuma</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerding</unclear> abgericht unnd bezalt habe, unnd über dz
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köuffer</unclear> mit vorgedachtem unnserm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanndt</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/>vogt deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inzugs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halben</unclear> nit deß einen werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mögen</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgedachter</unclear> üwer burger <persName resp="#ner">Sigmund <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zollikhoffer</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="25"/>alls <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verkhöuffer</unclear> (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermog</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sines</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethonen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versprech</unclear>-
<lb n="26"/>ens) mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserem</unclear> landtvogt deß orts also <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abkhomen</unclear>,
<lb n="27"/>daran wir anstatt unnser herren unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obren</unclear> inn
<lb n="28"/>dyßhalb uff gelegten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thagung</unclear> woll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernuegt</unclear> unnd
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">friden</unclear> gsin sind. Durch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erzelte</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>stuckh alle unnd jede, dißer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauff</unclear> nach Eidtgnössischen
