<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bruch</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwonheiten</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseres</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erachtens</unclear>,) zuo
<lb n="32"/>sölchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">krefften</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear>, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölcher</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lüchtlich</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestürtzt</unclear> oder zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rugkh</unclear> zogen werden mag. Nichts
<lb n="34"/>desto weniger unnd dessen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alles</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">onangesehen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderstande</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Iedoch</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köueffer</unclear>, ein sölchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">albereit</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voltzognen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kouff</unclear> mit recht wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzeheben</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uncrefftig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuomachen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inmaßen</unclear> dann er ob-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genannten</unclear> üweren burger vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eidt</orgName>-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnoßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> da der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verköueffer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesäßen</unclear>, schon al-
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bereit</unclear> verklagt unnd inn recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefasset</unclear> haben
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölle</unclear>. Diewyl dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölche</unclear> sachen eben
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sältzam</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wunderbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürkhomend</unclear>, daruß
<lb n="43"/>(<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wann</unclear> sy also gestattet unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogeben</unclear> werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölten</unclear>)
<lb n="44"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölcher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inganng</unclear> in unser <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoschafft</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="45"/>gemacht unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ingefüert</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear>, das hieruß
<lb n="46"/>annders nit dann allerley <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zerrüttung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ervolgte</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>unnd keiner mer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüßte</unclear>, wann er mit einem
<lb n="48"/>anndern ein redliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hanndlung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abreden</unclear> oder
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">träffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear>, ob er daran <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habhafft</unclear> unnd ver-
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwüßt</unclear> were oder nit. Hardurch dann die ober-
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kheiten</unclear> an allen orten vil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müey</unclear> unnd arbeit
<lb n="52"/>uffladen und gnuog zuschaffen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">überkhomen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurden</unclear>.
<lb n="53"/>Das man aber billich nit gestatten noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschechen</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölle</unclear>. Es were dann sach, das wir die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>-
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lendischen</unclear> in sölchem fahl beßer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hallten</unclear> unnd
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">höcher</unclear> achten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weder</unclear> unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eigen</unclear> zuo-
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethann</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeborene</unclear> burger, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lanndtlüt</unclear> und
<lb n="58"/>Eidtgnossen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dem</unclear> allem nach, und
<lb n="59"/>dwyl wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieruß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> anders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khönnend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schlüßen</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1507_5427.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="60"/>dann er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köüffer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uern</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ankomen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> er aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelti</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllte</unclear> begegnet sin,
<lb n="62"/>So habend wir uff obgedachts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwers</unclear> burgers <persName resp="#ner">Sigmund
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikhoffers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoter</unclear> fründen, von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sinetwägen</unclear> beschechen
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhaldten</unclear>, nit ermanglen wellen, üch durch diß unnser
<lb n="65"/>früntlich schryben, guoter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnößischer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wollmeinung</unclear>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoermanen</unclear>, wie wir üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> das woll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuolhuwensind</unclear>,
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdend</unclear> den von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ramenschwag</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sines</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unge</unclear>-
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rympten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnemens</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erenst</unclear> ab: unnd dahin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear>.
<lb n="69"/>Das er dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jhenigen</unclear>, das er einmal nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> ingangen
<lb n="70"/>unnd versprochen, sonnder ouch mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halbkoinner</unclear> be-
<lb n="71"/>zallung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestättiget</unclear>. unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">becrefftiget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hact</unclear>, nachma-
